    {
      "text": "DSPM validates the cloud accounts every hour to check if the onboarding templates are deployed successfully and roles and permissions are configured for each account. You can also run an on-demand validation without waiting for DSPM's hourly validations."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Validating a Single Account",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To validate a single account:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Data Security > DSPM > Cloud Accounts.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          52
        ],
        [
          55,
          69
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Cloud Accounts page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Cloud Accounts page, click the required cloud account (AWS, Azure, or GCP).",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          21
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the Accounts tab for AWS, Subscriptions tab for Azure, or Projects tab for GCP.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          11,
          19
        ],
        [
          33,
          46
        ],
        [
          65,
          73
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The tab name varies depending on the selected cloud account.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Actions icon for the account you want to validate, and click On Demand Validation.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          17
        ],
        [
          71,
          91
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The On Demand Validation window appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          24
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the On Demand Validation window, click Confirm.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          27
        ],
        [
          42,
          49
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Validating all Accounts in the Organization",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
